      "created_at": "2025-01-28T18:59:10.987Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I was briefly thinking about offering to GM, but I am afraid my free time is far too limited at the moment.<br>\nNot enough for ad-hoc learning the tools of a new site and still keeping a group of people on their toes at the same time, anyway.</p>\n<p>But if you don’t mind someone reading along, could you post a link so that I can get an impression of how pbp works over there?</p>",
